  "narrative": "Starting from a high reference-class anchor near 0.75, multiple up-dates from a persistently high pace of deaths, spring crossings, and large recent annual totals push the probability toward crossing 1,000 deaths before May 2026. Persistent uncertainties around SAR capacity and data reporting remain important caveats.",
